As a Junior Maintenance Coordinator, you support the technical maintenance of the largest and most complex heat grid of Ennatural: The central and west Brabant heat grid. This network provides heat to thousands of households and companies in Tilburg, Breda and Geertruidenberg. You learn how to prevent malfunctions, improve performance and prepare and guide work well. You work closely with experienced fellow officers and get plenty of space to grow in independence and responsibility. In this junior role you get the chance to learn the profession. You're dealing with:
