Koppert grows fast. In greenhouses, biological pest control has become commonplace, but we also work hard and successfully in the open crops. To strengthen our technical commercial team we are looking for a:
Technical Commercial Consultant Agri
36-40 hours per week, Rayon South Netherlands and Northern Belgium
What are you gonna do?
In this position, you are responsible for realising our commercial ambitions in collaboration with our distributors and chain partners. This is to support our end customers (current and organic growers). You do this mainly in the South of the Netherlands and Northern Belgium. Since the delivery of our products is often done via distributors, you have a lot of contact with their outdoor service and make sure that the right product information is known to these parties. You are also a lot among growers to convince them of the transition to and use of our product portfolio. You do this in collaboration with our distribution partners.
You will also visit farmers, green grove and fruit growers to assist them in optimizing their cultivation. You are an important advisor to the customer and bring added value through your knowledge about market developments, innovations, research and experience on (organic) plant protection. You explore the market potential and build a strong network. Customer developments are briefly recorded in our CRM system to optimize customer management. You also represent Koppert, by giving presentations, during external marketing activities and network meetings.
