You will be part of the Sales team with 5 account managers working within the Horti and Agri market. Together you are set up to achieve our commercial goals while ensuring that the customer's needs are met by offering them the best possible solutions and support. You also frequently collaborate with Market Development, Customer & Supply Chain Service and the Technical Consultants. You report to the Sales Manager Netherlands.
