Your work
- mapping of environmental risk and opportunities within spatial projects;
- Advising on flora, fauna, protected species and biodiversity;
- To determine and guide the necessary ecological research;
- Translating research results into practical measures;
- Ecological reporting and advice;
- Keying plans to nature law and omgevi.

